  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p>On expanding <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math> along <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math>, we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#177;</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math></p><p>If&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math>, then</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>sin</mi><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mfenced><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>13</mn><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>If&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math>, then</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>sin</mi><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>13</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></math></p>"
